title: "Variation in 24 NF-kB regulatory genes across human populations: derived data and historical analysis code"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Maghembe"
    given-names: "Reuben S."
repository-code: "https://github.com/rmaghembe1/project6-nfkb-public-release"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
abstract: >-
  Public release of author-derived population-genomic and external-annotation
  tables and a historical source-code snapshot supporting analysis of 24 human
  NF-kappaB regulatory genes across populations. The code snapshot is not a
  fully executable end-to-end analytical workflow. Third-party data rights
  and attribution conditions remain with their respective providers.
keywords:
  - NF-kappaB
  - population genomics
  - human genetic variation
  - derived data
  - research software
